WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.886
Two rental fleets. Same street.

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:07.128
Frank's week: a pile of violation notices, all past due,

00:00:07.178 --> 00:00:09.976
tolls charged to his account automatically,

00:00:10.026 --> 00:00:12.576
and all of it comes out of his pocket.

00:00:12.626 --> 00:00:15.386
Mike's week? A car comes back.

00:00:15.436 --> 00:00:20.984
MyEZToll catches every toll and violation in time, and bills the driver, plus a fee.

00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:26.171
Mike gets it all back, and a share of that fee. His cost? Zero.

00:00:26.221 --> 00:00:28.996
Frank's asking the same question you are.

00:00:29.046 --> 00:00:33.654
MyEZToll. Stop losing. Start earning.
